  m_text: "THE ROOM \u2014 CONTROLS\r\n\r\nPC SIMULATOR\r\nPoint + Left Click \u2014
    Interact\r\nShift + 2 \u2014 Spawn Bottle\r\nShift + 1 \u2014 Inside / Outside
    View\r\n2 \u2014 Change Light Color\r\n1 \u2014 Quit\r\n\r\nXR CONTROLLERS\r\nPoint
    + Grip \u2014 Interact\r\nLeft Secondary \u2014 Spawn Bottle\r\nLeft Primary
    \u2014 Inside / Outside View\r\nRight Secondary \u2014 Change Light Color\r\nRight
    Primary \u2014 Quit\r\n\r\nUse the Control Panel to switch THROW / ORBIT mode.\nInteract
    with the Cargo Crate to spawn a crystal."
